WEBVTT

01:03:27.942 --> 01:03:30.513
that are in the next 15 or 20 years.

01:03:30.887 --> 01:03:32.712
CA: I have to say, I love that vision.

01:03:32.736 --> 01:03:36.680
And I very, very, very much hope
that that is what happens.

01:03:37.053 --> 01:03:39.836
Kai-Fu Lee, thank you so much
for spending all this time --

01:03:39.860 --> 01:03:41.241
it's really so fascinating.

01:03:41.265 --> 01:03:43.260
Thank you so much for your time.

01:03:43.284 --> 01:03:45.379
KFL: Thank you, thanks for having me.

01:03:45.403 --> 01:03:52.403
(Music)

01:03:53.483 --> 01:03:54.871
CA: That was Kai-Fu Lee,

01:03:54.895 --> 01:03:58.569
a computer scientist and one
of the leading tech investors in China.

01:03:58.593 --> 01:04:01.790
To listen to Kai-Fu's
TED Talk, visit TED.com.